    pushes enemies away



    - Allows Player to pass through projectiles and level
    Geometry



    - Block Incoming attacks within 90 degrees of your field of view.
    (Dashing + Shield applies a Burn and Slow Effect)



    - Absorbs Incoming projectiles
    and applies a damage boost to player''s attacks. Too many absorbed will cause
    the player to take damage

